I'm Hayami from the Maicho Newspaper.

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.510
I am going to interview the Cosplay Queen of the Comic Convention

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:39.010
Suspicious. I'd like you to come us as an important witness.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.350
— That's tyranny!
— Then report me!

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:44.320
— You think you're all that?!
— Obstruction of justice!

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.260
Stop, you!

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:49.320
Love hotline!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:53.260
Sorry! I have to go to work,
So I'll be going!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:54.860
Follow her!

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.100
Ladies and gentlemen!
Sorry to have kept you waiting!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:01.010
Next up is the "Female Detective
Na-chan is a Whirlwind"

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:05.170
cosplay performance and
autograph session, start!

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:09.550
Get out of my way!
I'm going to arrest all of you!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:15.010
Autograph Ceremony Last Line Here

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.520
I guess that really does exist.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.820
I'm not letting you go!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.950
Oh my!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.400
Good... morning...

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.330
Quietly...

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:34.000
Coming in so early?

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:35.000
I'm sorry!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.940
Being a temp must be easy...

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.380
I'm sorry!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.050
So you've finally come.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.740
Why are you late today?
If you don't want to come, quit!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:45.380
I'm sick of this...
I'm fed up...

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.980
— I ought to fire you!
— I'm sorry!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.950
Well then, Kisaragi-san,
I'm counting on you.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.390
See ya!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:02.330
Life sure is hard...

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.580
All right! I'm gonna do my best!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.890
Overtime again?

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:27.290
— Granny!
— They're so quick to make you do all the work!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.490
It's all right,
I didn't come in during the day.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.620
So you deserve it, huh?
I guess it can't be helped.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.660
But I can eat you rice balls!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:39.370
Delicious! There's something
different about yours, really!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:42.170
What are you saying?
They're just normal rice balls.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:44.340
I got it. These!

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:46.240
These hands are what
make them delicious!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:50.270
Some kind of infrared ray must come out
of them! Or delicious-food-making rays!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.910
Are you hitting on me?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.950
I would've fallen for it thirty years ago...

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.320
I'll help you clean up.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.010
The Next Day

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.090
Police Headquarters

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:01.800
Why?

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.500
Why do I have to be relieved of my duties?

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:06.680
Aki-kun!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:10.990
Panther Claw's special forces, which have
been destroying everything up until now,

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.440
were all arrested by me!
And yet, why?!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:19.470
Wasn't that due to Honey Flash or what's-her-face,
a civilian, cooperating with you?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.110
Isn't she nice? All smooth and flashy.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.880
I'm gonna transform, was it?

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:27.820
What's so funny?
Panther Claw's armament.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:31.690
That Cutie Honey woman's
transformation ability. Physical abilities.

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:34.630
All of them are completely beyond
our scientific technology.

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.150
If this continues, we don't
know what will happen next!

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:38.790
That's why, Aki-kun.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:42.320
This case is no longer at the level
a mere inspector can handle!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.270
Is that so?

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.310
Take a vacation starting tomorrow!

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:51.270
Rest! And think about what
you're going to do from now on!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.000
Thank you very much.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:56.650
Stop! You don't need
a gun for your vacation!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:12.060
That's it!

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:17.130
You lazy good for nothings can just sit
around in the government or whatever!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.870
I still have eight hours.

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:22.570
Just you watch!
I'll bring back sure fire evidence!

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:26.480
Inspector, cheer up!
Guess she didn't hear me...

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:30.180
Let her be. She doesn't need us.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.150
She always thinks she
can do it by herself.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:40.760
My, I'm delighted! I didn't know I'd be
interrogated by a beautiful detective!

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:42.660
Inspector!
Not detective but inspector!

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.960
Why are you so tense?
You've got such a great smile.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.990
Well then. I have something
I absolutely must know.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:53.230
Sure. If you give me your cell number,
I'll tell you whatever you want!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.970
If you go out with me, I'll forget
about how you arrested me...

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:59.430
Look here! What is this
Imaginary Induction System?

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:01.310
Huh? What's that?

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:04.110
My my... I heard it from you.

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:07.850
No way. I don't talk
about stuff I don't know.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:09.690
Really? Then take a look at this.

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:14.220
Imaginary Induction System.
The power that shapes human thought.

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:18.190
Because you have a human heart,
it's okay for you to use that power, no?

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:23.030
The world renowned nano-machine developer Professor Kisaragi's only daughter, Kisaragi Honey-san.

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:27.330
She passed away due to an accident
a year ago. Then, who's this?

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:29.170
How you'd get this?

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:33.270
Exhibitions like that always have
people taping cute girls like her.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:36.110
Seems you chose the wrong
place to run to, Hayami-san.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.210
I lost! But you did
a good job finding us.

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:42.850
— I'm the type that likes footwork.
— Sorry, I didn't notice.

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:46.690
Panther Claw's low level members,
called "Combatants".

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:50.260
Immediately after they lose combat
capability, they seem to disappear.

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:52.120
According to the scientific team,

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:55.830
if they weren't made of special
nano-machines, that wouldn't be possible.

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:00.440
This one's a Special Forces type,
called " Panther Monsters".

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:04.240
They ceased to function upon
arrest, just like a machine.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:08.310
Now. Nano-machines. Professor Kisaragi.
The daughter that should've died.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.940
And the Imaginary Induction System.

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:14.220
Now, what's your trump card?

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:15.710
Brilliant!

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:19.660
Since they have someone like you,
Na-chan, headquarters must be at ease.

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:22.220
Na-chan?! Don't even think about
talking your way out of this!

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:27.230
The armed organization, Panther Claw.
Their purpose is still unknown.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.600
The only thing that is known is that their
higher ranks are called the Four Gods,

00:23:30.600 --> 00:23:34.370
and their leader's name is... Sister Jill.

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:36.970
Sister Jill?

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:40.710
Jill-sama. Sister Jill-sama.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:49.420
Gold Claw sends you this message:
The preparations for the party are complete.

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:56.660
Black Claw-sama, Scarlet Claw-sama,
Cobalt Claw-sama, are here.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:24:01.260
That ill-mannered Gold Claw...
I wonder what kind of party she prepared...

00:24:01.900 --> 00:24:05.900
Isn't that nothing more than a plan?
With even her brains being made of muscle...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:11.840
Well, why don't we wait and see? How much
that ill-mannered person can achieve...

00:24:26.860 --> 00:24:29.690
Wait a minute...
How come the Monsters don't disappear?

00:24:30.060 --> 00:24:33.330
You said so yourself!
They're made of the same nano-machines...

00:24:33.330 --> 00:24:37.430
yet the Combatants disappear, while the
Monsters only lose functionality. Why is that?

00:24:37.440 --> 00:24:40.770
— Wait a second!
— Where are they?!

00:24:40.770 --> 00:24:43.270
In the basement!
The basement of headquarters!

00:24:43.280 --> 00:24:46.340
— Do you know what a Trojan Horse is?
— It can't be! No way!

00:24:52.890 --> 00:24:55.320
Gold Claw...

00:24:55.990 --> 00:24:57.750
calls upon the heavens!

00:25:09.270 --> 00:25:10.530
Come on!

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:16.470
The suspect!

00:25:16.480 --> 00:25:18.270
I'll take responsibility for this!

00:25:19.710 --> 00:25:22.240
Yes! We've taken measure already...

00:25:22.250 --> 00:25:25.480
Leave it to us, minister! We won't...

00:25:27.350 --> 00:25:29.350
Destroy! Destroy!

00:25:29.860 --> 00:25:31.290
Grab her!

00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:34.560
— Stop it! — Stop it, you!
— Where do you think this is?!

00:25:38.800 --> 00:25:42.000
I'm going to destroy some more!

00:25:47.610 --> 00:25:49.040
What's going on?!

00:25:50.440 --> 00:25:52.470
I'm going to tamper
with you some more!

00:25:54.350 --> 00:25:56.370
I'm going to peep some more!

00:25:56.380 --> 00:25:59.110
Special X-ray Scope!

00:25:59.120 --> 00:26:01.950
What a mess! We can't do anything!

00:26:05.260 --> 00:26:10.590
Yes, this sounds good.
Now Jill-sama will be happy.

00:26:12.200 --> 00:26:14.060
As I thought, it's the Panther Monsters.

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:16.130
The chain of command is a mess!

00:26:16.140 --> 00:26:19.870
I'm sure they didn't think they'd get
attacked from within headquarters.

00:26:19.870 --> 00:26:23.810
Those silly looking bastards have
underestimated the Japanese Police!

00:26:24.280 --> 00:26:27.800
Are you gonna fight with that?
You should escape!

00:26:29.850 --> 00:26:31.910
I can't do that.

00:26:41.560 --> 00:26:44.160
— Kisaragi-kun, tea!
— Yes, sir.

00:26:56.280 --> 00:26:57.740
Seiji-kun?

00:26:57.840 --> 00:27:00.710
Yeah, okay. No way, really?

00:27:01.410 --> 00:27:03.750
Got it! I'll head there right now!

00:27:04.020 --> 00:27:07.010
Chief clerk!
Kisaragi Honey, taking an early leave!

00:27:09.820 --> 00:27:14.230
God!! I'm going to fire her!
Fire her for sure!

00:27:14.490 --> 00:27:21.260
Foolish human beings trying to stop us,
we must destroy their will.

00:27:21.330 --> 00:27:25.290
What do you think, Sister Jill-sama,
of tonight's celebration?

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:39.980
Jill-sama is delighted.

00:27:42.690 --> 00:27:44.450
Is she going to come soon?

00:27:44.460 --> 00:27:46.250
Fire! Open fire!

00:27:48.900 --> 00:27:52.260
Run away! We're no match for them!

00:27:54.600 --> 00:27:56.770
— Inspector!!
— Run away, recruit!

00:28:38.950 --> 00:28:44.010
In the middle of police headquarters
you dare to run wild?!

00:28:48.290 --> 00:28:50.760
Nice, inspector!

00:28:53.760 --> 00:28:55.820
You again?

00:28:55.900 --> 00:28:59.920
You know, the one
with bigger bullets wins!

00:29:07.570 --> 00:29:10.440
I guess this is the limit
of a regular human being.

00:29:10.440 --> 00:29:12.470
You're still here?!

00:29:12.480 --> 00:29:17.280
I'm a reporter first.
The main dish is yet to come.

00:29:20.790 --> 00:29:22.410
What's that?

00:29:27.190 --> 00:29:30.490
You again? Biker girl!

00:29:31.160 --> 00:29:34.000
I'm so sorry.
Looks like you've run out of ammo.

00:29:34.000 --> 00:29:35.660
Don't mess with me!

00:29:39.840 --> 00:29:41.600
Are you okay, Seiji-kun?

00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:46.680
I knew it. Beauties and special scoops
always appear in the best places!

00:29:46.680 --> 00:29:49.200
— You think you're on our side of justice?
— I guess so...

00:29:49.220 --> 00:29:50.580
Good for you.

00:29:50.580 --> 00:29:52.810
Now, now. Na-chan and Honey.

00:29:52.820 --> 00:29:53.950
Na-chan?

00:29:55.920 --> 00:29:58.950
Getting rid of those
bastards is our first priority.

00:29:58.960 --> 00:30:00.220
You're right.

00:30:01.660 --> 00:30:05.620
Stand back, you two.
This is a job for me!

00:30:06.200 --> 00:30:08.130
Did you run away, you little mouse?!

00:30:08.130 --> 00:30:10.000
Hey, Combatant! Reload!

00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:12.490
— Yes, boss!
— You a recruit? — Yes, sir!

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:14.270
Load 'em up!

00:30:14.270 --> 00:30:17.900
Yes, boss! Today's bullets are
new, higher powered models!

00:30:17.910 --> 00:30:20.940
Now I'm going to hit it for good measure,
and in three seconds, it'll go bang!

00:30:20.950 --> 00:30:23.310
Is that so?

00:30:23.650 --> 00:30:26.680
Doctor! Emergency patient!

00:30:27.350 --> 00:30:29.690
I'm gonna tamper with you!
Human! Human!

00:30:30.790 --> 00:30:31.980
Great!

00:30:31.990 --> 00:30:34.290
Hey! Look here!

00:30:34.930 --> 00:30:39.390
I only have this towel on me! If somebody
steals a glimpse, I don't know what I'll...

00:30:39.400 --> 00:30:42.230
Naked flesh!

00:30:45.170 --> 00:30:46.500
Oh my!

00:30:46.510 --> 00:30:50.030
— That's so good!
— Honey!

00:30:50.640 --> 00:30:54.270
So if you underestimate a Japanese
policewoman, this is what happens!

00:30:54.280 --> 00:30:57.580
Bullshit! You're no policewoman!

00:30:57.580 --> 00:31:00.250
My, I've been found out.
Well, then.

00:31:01.820 --> 00:31:04.310
Honey Flash!

00:31:14.300 --> 00:31:16.270
Who the hell...?!

00:31:17.570 --> 00:31:20.000
Stars in the sky. Flowers on the earth.

00:31:20.040 --> 00:31:21.560
Love to human beings!

00:31:21.710 --> 00:31:25.080
Warrior of love, Cutie Honey!

00:31:26.410 --> 00:31:28.400
That's it?

00:31:28.410 --> 00:31:29.850
Let's go, scumbags!

00:31:30.580 --> 00:31:33.680
Panther Flash!

00:31:35.960 --> 00:31:38.120
— Crush the Sky!
— Split the earth!

00:31:38.120 --> 00:31:39.350
Peep on the human beings!

00:31:39.360 --> 00:31:42.420
Warrior of evil, Triple Panther!

00:31:42.430 --> 00:31:44.560
Here we go, Honey!

00:31:44.560 --> 00:31:47.430
Do you think you can beat us three?

00:31:47.430 --> 00:31:49.560
— Blow everything up!
— Operate on everything!

00:31:49.600 --> 00:31:51.260
And peep while we kill you!

00:31:52.010 --> 00:31:53.370
Huh?

00:31:53.370 --> 00:31:57.640
Revived Monsters are easily beaten.
Isn't that the promise?

00:31:57.640 --> 00:31:59.340
That's a stupid promise!

00:31:59.350 --> 00:32:02.800
— I wanted to do so much more...!
— I wanted to peep on more people!

00:32:07.250 --> 00:32:09.690
Yay! Tama! Narita!

00:32:09.690 --> 00:32:12.020
— Pretty good!
— Where does all that power...

00:32:12.030 --> 00:32:14.360
Please! It's nothing really...

00:32:14.360 --> 00:32:16.350
Here, here! Pictures for the scoop!

00:32:16.360 --> 00:32:18.460
What the hell are you doing?

00:32:19.130 --> 00:32:22.120
Golden Hammer!

00:32:22.470 --> 00:32:25.130
Finishing Blow!

00:32:31.380 --> 00:32:33.210
That hurt!

00:33:20.260 --> 00:33:24.360
To be fine after such an attack...
This'll be interesting.

00:33:24.360 --> 00:33:28.960
Why don't you give up, old hag?
Showing your midriff like that...

00:33:28.970 --> 00:33:31.160
I went easy on you last time.

00:33:31.170 --> 00:33:33.970
I wonder what'll happen
if you go all out?

00:33:34.040 --> 00:33:35.770
You'll lose, of course!

00:33:35.780 --> 00:33:37.570
I wonder!

00:33:51.990 --> 00:33:55.020
Wow! She's gonna
throw away her womanhood?

00:34:00.370 --> 00:34:04.330
I guess she wants to fight
to the bitter end. You got it!

00:34:05.410 --> 00:34:06.960
Now, here I come!

00:34:15.310 --> 00:34:17.340
You little bitch!

00:34:29.800 --> 00:34:33.160
It's time for you to pay.

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:36.760
Hey! Honey!

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:43.170
Uh oh!

00:34:45.980 --> 00:34:48.410
The situation's been reversed!

00:34:50.880 --> 00:34:53.780
Shut up. Shall I crush you, bitch?

00:34:54.050 --> 00:34:56.280
Hey, stop right there!

00:34:56.620 --> 00:34:59.220
This is the worst thing
that could happen.

00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:01.920
Stop it! Let her go!

00:35:01.930 --> 00:35:04.400
You say some interesting things.

00:35:04.400 --> 00:35:05.960
No! Don't do it!

00:35:05.970 --> 00:35:08.090
What will you do if I let her go?

00:35:08.100 --> 00:35:09.530
I'll...

00:35:09.540 --> 00:35:12.230
Your power... resembles Jill-sama's...

00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:13.470
Jill?

00:35:13.470 --> 00:35:18.070
Sister Jill. She gave birth to us and rules
over us. She's our absolute matriarch!

00:35:18.340 --> 00:35:21.040
Sister Jill... is that you leader's name?

00:35:21.050 --> 00:35:25.070
That's right. She'll be very
pleased if I take you to her.

00:35:25.080 --> 00:35:27.050
Now, put down your weapon!

00:35:30.090 --> 00:35:33.460
Don't do it!
Isn't this revenge for your father?

00:35:33.460 --> 00:35:34.480
How do you know...

00:35:34.490 --> 00:35:37.590
Then you shouldn't worry
about me, just finish her off!

00:35:37.600 --> 00:35:40.070
— How could l...
— What are you waiting for? Hurry!

00:35:40.070 --> 00:35:42.630
— Na-chan!
— Don't call me "Na-chan"!

00:35:51.040 --> 00:35:54.210
So that's what you usually look like?

00:35:54.580 --> 00:35:57.010
The clothes aren't necessary!

00:36:07.560 --> 00:36:09.720
How do you like that, little bitch?

00:36:10.460 --> 00:36:12.400
This is a little too...

00:36:13.100 --> 00:36:16.330
Now, let go of Na-chan!

00:36:16.540 --> 00:36:20.270
Sure, I'll let go of her.
After she's stopped breathing, of course.

00:36:21.070 --> 00:36:23.770
Why are you surprised?
You should've known that much!

00:36:28.610 --> 00:36:31.280
You're not getting away
with this, you monster!

00:36:32.190 --> 00:36:35.350
Good. Your painful expression is great.

00:36:35.350 --> 00:36:37.520
My virgin heart is pounding...

00:36:37.520 --> 00:36:40.750
— You're a woman?
— You just realized?!

00:36:41.290 --> 00:36:42.960
Do you think...

00:36:42.960 --> 00:36:45.950
Do you think I'll lose to this?

00:36:45.970 --> 00:36:50.460
Idiot! If you don't transform, you won't
be able to escape my shackles...

00:36:50.470 --> 00:36:53.930
My neck... The choker on my neck!

00:36:53.940 --> 00:36:56.910
The choker on her neck?
Is that the transformation switch?!

00:36:57.110 --> 00:36:58.770
I still have one bullet left!

00:36:58.780 --> 00:37:01.370
What do you think you're doing?

00:37:02.420 --> 00:37:04.410
That's quite a piece of armor.

00:37:04.650 --> 00:37:07.050
Honey! Hurry and transform!

00:37:14.160 --> 00:37:15.530
Yeah! Lucky!

00:37:15.530 --> 00:37:17.160
No way!

00:37:17.330 --> 00:37:22.130
Honey Flash!

00:37:27.110 --> 00:37:30.080
Where are you?
Show yourself, little bitch!

00:37:32.010 --> 00:37:35.950
Should l?
You cowardly and dirty Panther Claw!

00:37:36.250 --> 00:37:38.620
Sometimes, a very skilled bike racer.

00:37:38.620 --> 00:37:41.610
Sometimes, a Panther Claw recruit Combatant.

00:37:41.620 --> 00:37:44.420
And sometimes, a beautiful angel in white!

00:37:44.420 --> 00:37:47.050
A beauty with nothing but a towel.
A mysterious policewoman!

00:37:47.060 --> 00:37:49.460
An invincible armored female warrior!

00:37:49.460 --> 00:37:52.330
But, my true identity is...

00:37:53.170 --> 00:37:54.890
What is this?!

00:38:00.970 --> 00:38:04.170
Warrior of love, Cutie Honey!

00:38:08.110 --> 00:38:10.710
As long as I, Cutie Honey, exist,

00:38:10.720 --> 00:38:13.180
I won't allow Panther Claw
to do as they wish!

00:38:13.390 --> 00:38:15.680
Prepare yourself, Gold Claw!

00:38:17.360 --> 00:38:19.760
Now it's come to this,
my last resort!

00:38:19.760 --> 00:38:23.200
Gold Claw Breast Missiles!

00:38:26.170 --> 00:38:29.330
My breasts are firmer
than yours, old hag!

00:38:35.210 --> 00:38:39.470
Silver Fleuret Lightning Shower!

00:38:41.850 --> 00:38:45.370
Honey Spiral Typhoon!

00:38:47.620 --> 00:38:51.420
Gold Claw, a candle in the wind!

00:38:58.360 --> 00:39:03.320
Gold Claw... Big Death!

00:39:20.050 --> 00:39:24.610
Wow, amazing! It's gold dust!

00:39:27.860 --> 00:39:29.190
Let me explain!

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:33.960
Cutie Honey's fleuret frequency synchronized
with the Panther Monster's nano-machines...

00:39:33.970 --> 00:39:37.400
vaporizing the Monster in five seconds!

00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:38.600
Is that true?

00:39:38.600 --> 00:39:40.000
I just wanted to say it!

00:39:40.010 --> 00:39:41.060
What a big mouth...

00:39:41.070 --> 00:39:43.840
Well, it seems like you were
at least trying to do something.

00:39:43.840 --> 00:39:46.870
With you two as my opponents,
I'd be scared at night!

00:39:52.150 --> 00:39:54.710
Japan is a society governed by law.

00:39:54.720 --> 00:39:58.320
Personal revenge is not allowed.
You know that, right?

00:39:58.320 --> 00:40:02.190
But... you told me to fight back then...

00:40:02.190 --> 00:40:06.320
That was an emergency situation!
I won't let you get involved any more.

00:40:07.600 --> 00:40:10.730
But thanks, for protecting headquarters.

00:40:14.210 --> 00:40:15.500
Of course, Na-chan!

00:40:15.510 --> 00:40:19.310
Aki Natsuko! The next time you call me
Na-chan, I'm really going to arrest you!

00:40:19.310 --> 00:40:21.280
Geez, you're stubborn!

00:40:21.280 --> 00:40:23.310
Huh? Where's Seiji-kun?

00:40:23.680 --> 00:40:26.010
He ran away, that bloke!

00:40:37.400 --> 00:40:40.560
Good night, Jill-sama.

00:40:40.700 --> 00:40:43.030
Pitiful. Is this what you call a party?

00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:45.500
Useless... We wasted our time.

00:40:45.500 --> 00:40:49.100
Well, for being an idiot,
Gold tried her best...

00:40:49.180 --> 00:40:52.800
Cutie Honey...
That's great... just superb!

00:40:52.810 --> 00:40:55.870
Jill-sama, next time l,
Cobalt Claw, will go.

00:40:55.880 --> 00:40:57.280
As you wish.

00:40:58.520 --> 00:41:01.450
Whoa... Cobalt, you look serious!

00:41:01.450 --> 00:41:04.950
I'll take her,
so you better not interfere.

00:41:04.960 --> 00:41:09.330
Interfere? No way!
I always cooperate with you!

00:41:09.330 --> 00:41:11.960
Then stay put and
watch me, little girl.

00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:17.200
You shouldn't call a little girl "little"!
Right, Jill-sama?

00:41:18.700 --> 00:41:20.930
I'll be waiting...

00:41:33.750 --> 00:41:38.350
We appoint you as Captain of the Panther Claw Special Countermeasure Division... What's this?

00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:40.220
Our vacation is gone.

00:41:40.230 --> 00:41:41.720
That's the situation.

00:41:41.730 --> 00:41:45.690
The higher-ups just can't let an
energetic person like me do nothing.

00:41:45.700 --> 00:41:49.360
But this is steep...

00:41:49.600 --> 00:41:51.430
I'm counting on you.

00:41:51.600 --> 00:41:55.300
Last minute reversal, huh?
She's a strong person.

00:42:05.150 --> 00:42:06.910
It can't be!

00:42:07.350 --> 00:42:10.320
Na-chan! So it was you, Na-chan!

00:42:10.320 --> 00:42:14.050
I always wondered who lived there,
since nobody was ever home!

00:42:14.290 --> 00:42:17.320
Na-chan, wow! We're neighbors!

00:42:17.330 --> 00:42:18.600
<i>Now we can see each other everyday!</i>

00:42:18.600 --> 00:42:20.400
I guess the Ai-system has learned
friendship. This has become interesting.

00:42:20.400 --> 00:42:23.430
<i>Na-chan! Na-chan! Na-chan!</i>

00:42:24.440 --> 00:42:27.610
Hello? Yes, I'm still on surveillance.

00:42:27.610 --> 00:42:30.870
Abnormalities?
Of course, I've got a security plan.

00:42:30.910 --> 00:42:33.000
If anything goes wrong, I'll destroy her.

00:42:33.010 --> 00:42:34.450
Yes. Bye-bye.

00:42:43.120 --> 00:42:47.710
Episode 1: Heaven

00:42:47.830 --> 00:42:51.210
The End

00:42:51.210 --> 00:42:53.060
Into your heart!

00:42:58.770 --> 00:43:00.640
Broken my heart!

00:43:06.150 --> 00:43:08.170
Into your heart!

00:43:15.290 --> 00:43:19.720
On a sleepless night, in my heart,
Nemure nai yoru mune no naka de

00:43:19.730 --> 00:43:23.390
my shaking heartbeat,
Yureteru kodou ga

00:43:23.400 --> 00:43:27.160
As if harshly engraving a rhythm,
Hageshiku rythm kizamu youni

00:43:27.170 --> 00:43:30.860
Started to throb violently.
Takanari hajimeta no

00:43:30.870 --> 00:43:32.200
Into your heart!

00:43:32.200 --> 00:43:38.800
I've always been able to hear your voice.
Itsumo kikoeru anata no koe

00:43:39.610 --> 00:43:43.780
I don't want this to change.
Kono mama itsumade mo

00:43:43.820 --> 00:43:49.080
Please let me continue to hear it by your side!
Soba de kikitsuzuketai

00:43:49.390 --> 00:43:54.380
You and I. Please don't change!
You and I. Kawaranaide zutto

00:43:54.490 --> 00:44:00.060
Live on just the way you are,
Aruga mama ni ikite yukeru

00:44:00.070 --> 00:44:04.530
If you stay.
Anata ga soko ni

00:44:04.540 --> 00:44:09.670
For your love! There for me,
For your love! Ite kureta nara

00:44:09.680 --> 00:44:14.540
I can walk
Doko made mo aruite!

00:44:14.550 --> 00:44:19.280
Anywhere!
Yukeru yo

00:44:20.890 --> 00:44:22.850
Into your heart!

00:44:29.760 --> 00:44:32.890
In order to make Sister Jill happy,

00:44:32.900 --> 00:44:34.830
one of the Four Gods of Panther Claw,

00:44:34.830 --> 00:44:38.860
Cobalt Claw, and her evil traps
persistently aim for Honey's body.

00:44:38.870 --> 00:44:43.470
Also, Scarlet Claw's dirty trap
drives Honey's heart into a corner.

00:44:43.480 --> 00:44:46.310
How will Honey play an active role?

00:44:46.310 --> 00:44:52.330
Next episode of Re: Cutie Honey – Episode 2: Earth.
Please look forward to it!
